# []E_X unbinds a name in an interactive session only (M4): a program
# cannot use it to get around binding once (M1).
== SOURCE
a := 42
[]E_X "a"
a := 43
== ERROR
error[erase-outside-session]: []E_X unbinds a name in an interactive session only, as a statement of its own; in a program, bind a new name, or write a! for a value that changes at 8..17
